<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56328" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κε</span></b> , also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεν</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		, Lesb., <i><span class="en">
			Cypr.
		</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
			<u>Inscr.Cypr.</u>
			135.10
		</span></i> H., al.), Thess. (<i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			9(2).517.13
		</span></i>, al. (<span class="entity">Larissa</span>)); always enclitic, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄν</span>
			 and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾱ</span> (qq.v.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἄν . . ἀλλά κεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.290
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἄν . . οὐδέ κε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					19.272
				</span></i>
			, al.; both coupled, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄν κεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.187
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.361
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Parm.
				8.19
			</span></i>, etc.; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄσσα] κε θέλῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					1.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί κεν ποείην</span>; Ead.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				1787
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1
			</span></i> + <i><span class="en">
				2.16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεν ἄν</span> dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				4.1302.51
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cyme</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ κ᾽
				ἄν</span> (more prob. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰκ
			ἄν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(2).6
			</span></i> (Tegea, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κε</span> repeated, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.733
			</span></i>.</div>
